  "1inxudm": "Without a nonlinearity, any stack of linear layers is just one linear layer. ReLU is cheap, its gradient is 1 on the positive side so it does not shrink layer after layer like a sigmoid's, and it makes activations sparse (about half are 0). Newer models usually use GELU or SwiGLU instead of ReLU.", // Không có phi tuyến thì chồng bao nhiêu lớp tuyến tính cũng chỉ bằng m…
