  "a7xy8q": "The encoder's output \\(H\\) is computed once and reused by every decoder layer. At inference the decoder runs in a loop: each step generates one token, appends it to the input and runs again. To avoid recomputing K and V for the old tokens at every step, real systems keep them (the KV cache, see LLaMA 3).", // Output \(H\) của encoder được tính một lần, mọi lớp decoder đều dùng …
