  "1dbshk3": "One head can only form one attention distribution per token, that is, one kind of relation. Several heads can follow several kinds at once: one links verbs to their subjects, another links pronouns to the nouns they stand for. Splitting 512 = 8 × 64 keeps the total cost about that of a single 512-dimensional head. In translation, cross-attention heads often learn something close to an alignment table between source and target words.", // Một đầu chỉ tạo được một phân bố chú ý cho mỗi token, tức là một kiểu…
