  "tgal6h": "Pre-norm lets the residual stream x pass through all 32 layers without being renormalized at every step: signal and gradient go straight from start to end, so the deep network trains stably without the careful warmup that the original Transformer's Post-LN needs. In exchange, one more RMSNorm is needed at the end of the network.", // Pre-norm để dòng residual x đi xuyên 32 lớp mà không bị chuẩn hoá lại…
