  "8m8szp": "Self-attention with a causal mask, like the original Transformer's decoder, with 3 changes. Positions are encoded by rotating Q and K (RoPE). There are 32 query heads but only 8 key/value heads, each K/V head shared by 4 Q heads (GQA). The K and V of past tokens are kept (the KV cache) so they are not recomputed during generation.", // Self-attention có mặt nạ nhân quả như decoder của Transformer gốc, vớ…
